# Shell scripts must keep LF endings: they run on the Linux VPS, and a CRLF
# shebang line makes the interpreter fail with "bad interpreter". This repo is
# edited on Windows, and scripts/vps_update.sh was previously corrupted that
# way (it ended up saved as UTF-16 and would not run at all).
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
